WEBVTT

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:16.660
The murderer of Gavin Briggs
is still on the loose.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:21.830
The victim was a well-known philanthropist
who lost his fortune due to a scandal.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:24.910
Even so, he had hoped to begin anew.

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:29.200
In recent years, the number of atrocious
murders has sharply increased.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.160
Humanoid monsters are
the culprits for this rise.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:36.700
Including Representative Smith,
whose death is still fresh in our minds,

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:41.620
there is speculation that the murders of
Representative Carver and Secretary Bryson

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:43.830
were also caused by humanoid monsters.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:47.910
Humanoid monsters are the confirmed
culprits of the murder of Gavin Briggs.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:49.750
Humanoid monsters?!

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.830
Inhuman creatures.

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:55.830
They are the enemy of mankind.

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:58.620
It's all our fault, huh?

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:00.540
It's the <i>modus operandi</i> of mankind.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.120
The humanoid monsters, Alpha, Beta,
and Gamma are wanted for immediate capture.

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:10.120
We request any information available
about them from the public.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:57.160
I heard that Sonia was with
the humanoid monsters?!

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:00.040
It seems she is moving with Alpha.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:03.870
I will call her back immediately!

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:06.370
I will take care of it myself.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:07.370
Huh?

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:24.040
The council is serious
about capturing you all.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:26.700
Do you know the true face of the council?

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:33.200
I was sent Outside because I came in
contact with the council, a taboo.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:39.950
When I was a child,
I believed everything I saw.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:42.870
I was attacked by a thug in Outside once.

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:44.870
It was scary.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:48.950
But a young officer saved me.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.410
He looked so brilliant to me.

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:56.450
That was the moment I decided I was
going to protect the city from bad guys.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:04:01.450
I thought I would never lose to Outside,

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:05.120
but, at some point,
I had forgotten that feeling.

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:07.040
But Gavin was different.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:10.950
He didn't lose himself even
after he had been wronged.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:12.450
Gavin was serious.

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:17.410
Yes. He sacrificed himself to protect us.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:20.450
I had never met a human like that before.

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:25.540
You're right. In his eyes, you were
no different from another human.

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:29.830
Tell me. What about humanoid monsters?

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:33.660
You humans are the ones who call us that.

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:37.000
You've saved me many times.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:40.910
Even so, I shot at you...

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:42.660
I'm sorry.

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:47.160
I didn't have the courage to believe in you.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:49.250
Humans are weak.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:52.790
However, we are also envious of that.

00:04:52.790 --> 00:04:54.790
Envious?

00:04:54.790 --> 00:05:00.000
Humans live so desperately
because their lives are so fragile.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:03.290
In order to live, they betray comrades.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:09.790
At the same time, they sometimes
give their precious lives for a stranger.

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:13.410
I will believe in you.

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:19.450
I will go along with the contradictions
that humans create.

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:23.000
Thank you.

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:26.870
I never asked you your name.

00:05:27.910 --> 00:05:30.120
It's Bem.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:31.370
Bem...

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:37.620
Currently, Alpha is on the run
with Officer Summers as a hostage.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:41.410
Please contact us with
any sightings of them.

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:51.660
Bem is being treated like a complete criminal.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:54.080
Why is he with that woman?

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.910
I'm sure he's been deceived again.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:58.950
Bem is really stupid.

00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:03.580
What a scary face.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:06.500
Why do you always talk like that?

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:09.580
You still want to become human, Bela?

00:06:09.580 --> 00:06:12.620
Even after being treated like this?

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.250
I don't know...

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:18.870
But, the idea of living for all
eternity while feeling nothing--

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:22.370
There's nothing good about becoming human.

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:25.540
We should just leave them alone.

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:30.750
Though it looks like they don't
want to leave <i>us</i> alone.

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:35.000
Humanoid monsters are dangerous existences.

00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:39.830
I believe we should even institute
martial law until their capture.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:42.580
The council is controlling the news.

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:44.080
What do you plan to do?

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:47.410
At this rate, you will have nowhere to go.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:50.660
I had thought about it before.

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:54.080
This is the last weapon
for the weak, like us.

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:56.950
Something is strange.

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:15.250
ACES?! When did they get here?!

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:17.410
I wasn't the one who contacted them!

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:18.330
I know.

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.790
I reported this as a dutiful citizen!

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:22.250
What are you all doing?!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.750
There are other guests in there!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.580
This is the work of the humanoid monsters.

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:30.750
The humanoid monster took hostages where

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.700
he hid and sacrificed an innocent family.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:35.910
What are you saying?!

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:42.580
Also the work of humanoid monsters...

00:07:46.410 --> 00:07:49.370
Stop! There are civilians inside!

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.200
Get the car.

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:57.790
Got it!

00:07:57.790 --> 00:07:59.410
Shoot him on sight.

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.330
Don't worry about the hostages.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.500
Don't let him escape!

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.290
Monster!

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.160
Go!

00:08:31.700 --> 00:08:32.870
Shit.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:51.040
Aren't you the ruler of Libra City?

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.370
I wonder?

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:58.660
A shadowy council oversees
all the law and politics of this city.

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:02.540
And the one leading that council is you.

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:06.080
You're smart. You take after your father.

00:09:06.080 --> 00:09:09.370
My father discovered this secret
and was eliminated.

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:10.410
Isn't that right?

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:13.540
I felt bad for Mr. Bryson.

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:16.250
The people of the council are cowards.

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:20.750
They go crazy when anyone looks them up.

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:22.330
My father lost.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:26.950
But I'm different. I have proof.

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:32.910
If I don't return, everything
will be exposed to the public.

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:37.910
Oh, my. And what is it you want to do?

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.500
I want to rule this town.

00:09:40.500 --> 00:09:42.330
I want to take your place.

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:46.080
So, you want power.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:49.000
Humans always want a master.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:53.370
Because without a master,
they must think for themselves.

00:09:53.370 --> 00:09:58.540
However, you wish to take that position.

00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:00.370
How wonderful.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.200
Flattery will do nothing.

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:09.160
Perhaps I should leave this city to you.

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:10.580
Are you serious?

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:16.580
I will tell you a secret
I haven't told anyone else.

00:10:21.080 --> 00:10:24.370
Libra City's ten year anniversary?

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.500
That's me.

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:33.540
I made this city.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:36.450
That was over a hundred years ago...

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:39.370
It was like yesterday for me.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:45.120
My oldest memory is of the
alchemy lab in Ingolstadt.

00:10:45.120 --> 00:10:50.330
That night, he was ecstatic,
saying he had obtained the power of God.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:53.870
That is, until the Inquisition caught him.

00:10:53.870 --> 00:10:57.370
The alchemist that created me
was burned at the stake.

00:10:57.370 --> 00:11:02.120
I escaped to Rome and was
taken in by the Borgia family.

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:04.830
The flower of poison, Borgia.

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:07.620
From the father, Rodrigo,
I learned immorality.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:10.540
From the son, Cesare,
I learned Machiavellianism.

00:11:10.540 --> 00:11:16.080
From the daughter,
I learned of poison and love.

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:19.500
In other words, you are 500 years old?

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:22.370
Yes, if there is meaning to age.

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:27.040
Since then, I have watched this world.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.290
This cruel world.

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:33.000
Who are you?

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.250
A humanoid monster.

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:53.450
Vega doesn't die!

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:55.250
It's tiring.

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:57.660
Not being able to die is very troublesome.

00:11:57.660 --> 00:11:59.370
You can't die?

00:11:59.370 --> 00:12:00.370
Who's that?

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:02.250
She's human.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:05.160
But she's a little different
and quite interesting.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:08.370
I'm Harazy. Who are you?

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:09.450
Daryl...

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:12.000
Nice to meet you!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.620
Ouch!

00:12:15.620 --> 00:12:19.870
Humans are just so cute.

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:25.040
Tell Daryl about the council.

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:27.290
Understood.

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:31.870
You can ask about anything
you would like to know.

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:51.040
Yes. I want you to get away from
Libra City as soon as you can.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.950
Don't ask questions.

00:12:53.950 --> 00:12:56.200
I'm fine.

00:12:56.200 --> 00:12:58.790
Tell Papa and Mama.

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:02.620
Well... that I love everyone.

00:13:02.620 --> 00:13:04.830
Was that family safe?

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:11.330
How can you care so much about people?

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:20.540
Is it true that Sonia is
cooperating with Alpha?

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:20.540
It seems the humanoid monster continues
his escape with Officer Summers hostage.

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:22.870
An obvious breach in trust.

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:26.330
Will I be responsible as her overseer?

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:27.540
Of course.

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:30.790
Ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:32.200
What happened to Sonia?!

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:33.370
Well, that's...

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:35.830
It's Officer Summers.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.870
The one who killed Gavin was not Alpha.

00:13:38.870 --> 00:13:40.120
I saw it all.

00:13:40.120 --> 00:13:44.620
He was killed by the schemes of the
people who run this city in the shadows!

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:46.620
This is?!

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:48.790
She's done it now.

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:52.250
What has she done?! It's over for me!

00:13:52.250 --> 00:13:53.700
Please calm down.

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:56.950
No one would believe such nonsense!

00:13:56.950 --> 00:13:58.620
A blunder like this.

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:01.750
What do you think the council
will do once they hear of it?

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:03.540
The council!

00:14:03.540 --> 00:14:06.080
I will give you a chance.

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:07.700
We must look at the truth.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.870
We must see what is happening
right below our feet.

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:13.500
The humanoid monsters are not the problem.

00:14:13.500 --> 00:14:15.620
We are the problem.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:21.290
You want me to work with the police?

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.450
Fight poison with poison.

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:28.750
There are times we must dirty our hands
to protect the public order.

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:33.500
You have been practicing unlawful medicine.

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:36.330
However, we need your strength right now.

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.750
The council is watching over this.

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:40.830
It's not a bad deal for you.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:44.620
Can I really do what I want?

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:46.700
Unnecessary confirmation.

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:51.830
Everyone has gotten suspicious.

00:14:51.830 --> 00:14:55.540
The information about the
council is starting to spread.

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:59.700
Like-minded people are accessing the video.

00:14:59.700 --> 00:15:01.290
Like-minded?

00:15:01.290 --> 00:15:05.870
The people who have noticed the darkness
in this city, but never took action.

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:09.660
You and Gavin have connected
those individuals together.

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:11.080
Gavin and I?

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:14.250
Everyone wants to hear your story.

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:19.500
I see. If humans wish to speak with me,

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:20.910
I will meet them.

00:15:20.910 --> 00:15:22.700
I'm sure things will change.

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.540
What?

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:30.500
Officer Summers, you've done it this time.

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:31.830
Felt!

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:36.750
By the way, your family is in danger of
being targeted by Beta and Gamma.

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:41.870
Though a bit violently, we have taken your
family into custody for their protection.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:44.160
We will wait at the Colosseum.

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:46.000
I underestimated him...

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.290
This is all my fault...

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:49.330
Let us go.

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:50.950
Huh?

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:52.290
To the Colosseum.

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:58.910
There is no need to hesitate.

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:01.160
Your family comes first.

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:06.250
But there are finally people
who wish to talk with you...

00:16:06.250 --> 00:16:10.830
For you humans, families are
a special existence.

00:16:10.830 --> 00:16:14.790
They are people close to you in the
short time between birth and death.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:18.830
It is one of the most fleeting
and priceless of things.

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.000
I decided to protect you!

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.660
I can't betray you!

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:25.660
Do not worry. I will not die.

00:16:41.450 --> 00:16:44.700
Good work, Officer Summers.

00:16:44.700 --> 00:16:46.080
Where is my family?!

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:48.370
I have ordered them to be released.

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:53.450
Go.

00:16:59.580 --> 00:17:01.250
Chief of Headquarters?!

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:03.870
Why?!

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:07.750
The Chief of Headquarters helped
bring your family into custody.

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.540
Be grateful to him.

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:21.620
Bem...

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:30.700
Bem!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:58.000
What wonderful fighting prowess.

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:02.160
Madame?

00:18:06.660 --> 00:18:10.370
We finally meet, Bem.

00:18:10.370 --> 00:18:11.620
You are...?

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.200
I have come to get you.

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:15.620
Come with me.

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:16.830
I refuse.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.500
You refuse?

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:23.160
Does it hurt?

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:25.950
What is this power?!

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:28.200
Bem!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:31.080
You won't escape.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.160
Bem!

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.870
Why did you come?

00:18:41.870 --> 00:18:43.250
No reason...

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:47.120
Beta and Gamma have appeared, too.

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:49.330
You've been tricked again.

00:18:49.330 --> 00:18:51.290
I have not been tricked.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:53.200
I came of my own free will.

00:18:53.200 --> 00:18:56.120
That woman. I can't believe her.

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:58.660
She must be sticking her tongue
out at you in her mind.

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:00.830
No! I...

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:05.500
I can't move!

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:07.790
Is that her power?!

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:10.370
Madame, you...?!

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.620
Who are you?

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:17.450
I am Vega.

00:19:17.450 --> 00:19:20.700
I have been looking for you for so long.

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:24.870
I could always sense your existence.

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:25.700
Why?!

00:19:25.700 --> 00:19:29.660
I need you. In order to finish everything.

00:19:29.660 --> 00:19:31.000
Finish everything?

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:35.120
Bem. You cannot become human.

00:19:35.120 --> 00:19:37.250
And there's no need for such a thing.

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:41.160
They are such weak and selfish creatures.

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:44.790
Humans would never open their hearts to you.

00:19:44.790 --> 00:19:47.790
You know that most of all.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:53.830
See, you know.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:59.330
Think about all the things humans
have done to you until now.

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:03.040
So painful. So lonely. So pitiful.

00:20:03.040 --> 00:20:06.120
No one will save you.

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:08.950
Humans fear that which they do not know.

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:11.620
They hate and discriminate.

00:20:11.620 --> 00:20:13.500
Without knowing a thing.

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:22.000
No matter how much you wish for it,

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:24.910
you cannot become human
and you cannot die.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:28.040
For all eternity, you will
walk upon this land of hell.

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:30.700
Because you are an ugly monster!

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.790
An ugly monster!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:36.000
Monster!

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.040
So ugly!

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:39.540
Stay away!

00:20:58.250 --> 00:20:59.200
Bem?!

00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:00.410
Bem!

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:07.290
Harazy.

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:09.330
Hm?

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:10.410
Harazy?!

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:14.700
Everyone is troubled by that
scary monster that's going wild.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:15.870
Can you take care of it?

